For Questly, I’d recommend building it as more than a conventional to-do list. The core idea should be a gamified personal growth platform where productivity is the gameplay — users complete real-world tasks, build streaks, earn XP, unlock new visual experiences, play short in-app games, and see tangible evidence of their progress.

The key differentiator: Questly should reward actual effort and consistency, not just the number of tasks a user checks off.

