### Proposed progression system

| Action                            | Suggested reward       |
| --------------------------------- | ---------------------- |
| Complete a small quest            | 10–25 XP               |
| Complete a medium quest           | 25–50 XP               |
| Complete a major quest            | 50–100 XP              |
| Complete a verified focus session | 10–30 XP               |
| Reach a weekly goal               | Milestone bonus        |
| Finish a quest chain              | Achievement + bonus XP |

Treat these as initial balancing values. Rewards should be configurable and calibrated through testing.

The reward engine should prevent duplicate rewards, task-completion farming, and accidental double counting. XP should be calculated server-side and recorded in an immutable event ledger.

### Make streaks humane

- Count an active day based on a meaningful completed goal or focus session.
- Allow users to define their own daily target.
- Use local time zones for streak calculations.
- Provide rest days or optional streak protection.
- Avoid punishing users for sickness, holidays, or taking breaks.
- Track consistency and personal bests separately from total XP.

The goal is sustainable productivity, not guilt.

