### How games connect to productivity

The game system should complement the main app rather than compete with it.

- Games are accessible without completing tasks.
- Short games can be recommended during scheduled breaks.
- Game scores and personal bests appear on the user's profile.
- Achievements can unlock cosmetic items.
- Optional weekly challenges can connect focus goals to game achievements.
- Game sessions are tracked separately from productive focus time.
- Playing games must never count as productive work time.

For the MVP, implement two polished games rather than four unfinished ones. Snake and Memory Match would be a sensible starting pair.

