## Recommended technical architecture

For a polished MVP, use a web-first architecture with reusable UI and shared business logic.

Client applications

Next.js web app · Chrome extension · React Native mobile app

Shared services and API

Authentication · Tasks · Timer sessions · XP engine · Streaks · Achievements

Database and storage

PostgreSQL · User profiles · Quest history · Focus sessions · Game scores · Event ledger

Optional supporting services

Push notifications · Scheduled jobs · Analytics · AI coaching · Offline sync

### Suggested stack

| Layer             | Recommendation                            |
| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| Web application   | Next.js + TypeScript                      |
| UI                | Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui                  |
| Animations        | Framer Motion                             |
| Charts            | Recharts                                  |
| Mobile            | React Native + Expo                       |
| Browser extension | Chrome Manifest V3 + React                |
| Backend           | Next.js API or a dedicated TypeScript API |
| Database          | PostgreSQL via Supabase                   |
