| Validation        | Zod                                       |
| Game rendering    | Canvas API or Phaser                      |
| State management  | Zustand + TanStack Query                  |
| Testing           | Vitest + Playwright                       |

You do not have to implement all three clients immediately. Build the responsive web application first, design the API and data model for cross-platform use, and then develop the extension and mobile clients against the same services.

