| Achievements      | id, name, criteria, reward                                           |
| User achievements | user_id, achievement_id, unlocked_at                                 |
| Game sessions     | user_id, game_id, score, duration, played_at                         |
| User settings     | user_id, daily_target, notifications, privacy_options                |

Every user-owned record should be protected by authorization rules. If Supabase is used, implement and test Row Level Security policies.

Use an idempotent reward system so retries, duplicate requests, or offline synchronization cannot award XP twice.

For accurate timer tracking, persist session start times and reconcile elapsed time when the application resumes. Do not depend on an in-memory countdown alone.

