# Build Questly — A Gamified Productivity Platform

## Product Overview

Build a polished, production-oriented MVP called **Questly**, a gamified productivity and personal growth platform inspired by Duolingo, Strava, RPG progression systems, and modern indie games.

Questly turns real-world work into quests. Users create tasks, track their focused work time, build streaks, earn XP, unlock achievements, level up, play mini-games, and visualize their personal progress.

The defining feature is an adaptive interface that evolves visually as the user demonstrates consistent productivity and achieves milestones.

Do not build a static dashboard or a superficial UI mockup. Implement functional interactions, persistent data, correct business logic, loading and error states, and a maintainable architecture.

